    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Prompts per commit / PR (via hooks)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These metrics come from **Claude Code hooks** (see `hooks/`), which log a `prompt`, `commit`, `pr`, or `edit` event to Loki with the `session_id` \u2014 bridging the prompt\u2194commit gap OTEL can't. Ratios are over the selected time range. Requires the hooks installed via `.claude/settings.json` (or managed settings) and `CLAUDE_HOOK_LOKI_URL` reachable."
      }
    },
